# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Miku Music — what never goes in the repo.
#
#  Three rules, in order of how badly you do not want to get them wrong:
#    1. Nothing that can sign a build.
#    2. Nothing with a key, a password, a host, or an address in it.
#    3. Nothing a clean checkout can rebuild for itself.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── 1. Signing material ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The Falcon Technix platform key is what makes a MikuOS build trusted by the OS
# it replaces. It is not in this repo and it never will be.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.pk8
*.pem
*.p12
*.key
*.der
keystore.properties
signing/
platform.*

# ── 2. Secrets and anything personal ─────────────────────────────────────────
# local.properties carries the SDK path plus every build-time credential: the
# Last.fm API key and secret, the Windy key, the ingest host, the entitlement
# HMAC. Templates are committed, the real file never is.
local.properties
*.env
!*.env.example
secrets.*
*.token
# Network configs hold PSKs and personal addressing.
*.conf
!**/rsyncd.conf

# ── 3. Build output and tooling state ────────────────────────────────────────
build/
.gradle/
.cxx/
.kotlin/
captures/
gen/
*.hprof

# Android Studio / IntelliJ
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws

# ── Binaries ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# APKs belong on the Releases page. Git is bad at 100MB blobs, and a repo that
# carries every build forever stops being cloneable.
*.apk
*.aab
*.apks
*.apk.idsig
*.dex
*.ap_
*.so
*.img
*.zip
*.jar
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar

# ── Not ours to redistribute ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The 80 presets in app/src/main/assets/miku_presets/ ARE ours and are committed.
# projectM's "cream of the crop" pack and the 150 curated community presets are
# other people's work, by named authors, and the pack alone is 31MB. The README
# says where to get them.
app/src/main/assets/presets_pack.zip
app/src/main/assets/presets/

# Decompiled HiBy firmware and extracted stock apps. Useful on a workstation,
# not publishable: it is their code, and those trees hold third-party keys.
**/decompiled_vendor_software/
**/extracted_fs/
**/hiby-extracted/
**/vendor-media/
**/smali*/
minified_apks/
optional_apks/

# ── Agent / editor scratch ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/
.aider*
.cursor/
*.orig
*.rej
*.bak
*~

# ── OS noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Qualcomm's FM JNI library, pulled off the device. Theirs, not ours, and the FM
# path does not work anyway (SELinux denies /dev/radio0 to a platform_app).
fmradio/src/main/jniLibs/
